# NEVER the live capture zips: the scope puts the observing site's GPS (to 11
# decimal places) and its serial number in every manifest.json inside them.
# The .json/.log captures next to them are committed with sn/lat/long/alt
# scrubbed, the same way tests/fixtures/observations_list_odyssey_fw42.json is.
tests/fixtures/live/*.zip
